# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — Agent Rules

## Project settings

- Platform mode: {{PLATFORM_MODE}}
- Platforms: {{PLATFORMS}}
- Git sync: {{GIT_SYNC}}
- Plan collector: {{COLLECTOR}}
- Plan queue limits: {{QUEUE_LIMITS}}
